  "description": "The construction of a fourth and part fifth floor and the conversion of the first, second and third floors from offices (use class B1) to create 27 flats with associated parking and amenity space (existing ground floor offices to be retained)",
  "site_name": "Middlesex Court",
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
